So: even the aggressive suicide bot survived the full 5-minute cap (it got to wave 3 and was still alive when I stopped it). Current tuning: under sustained ramming, the player doesn't die in 5 minutes. M3's "player can die" fails against any realistic test budget.

Need a fix. Going with the plan: in training mode, collision damage bypasses i-frames, 1 damage per 15 frames of overlap. Faithful mode unchanged (original per-frame damage).

