Also, subEnergy needs a bypassInv parameter.

One fine point: subEnergy(1, true) with DIFF_0 halving: amt=1, not >1 → stays at 1 ✓. And when bypassing, _inv is not set — good (a collision shouldn't grant i-frames from enemy fire… or should it? If a collision sets i-frames, enemy shots get blocked more → the bot survives longer. Don't set _inv on a bypass collision: add `if (this.training && !bypassInv) this._inv = this.trainingInv;`… actually simpler: only set _inv when !bypassInv.

